  m_text: 'INSTRUCTIONS:


    1. Each tile in the grid can be clicked.


    2.
    Clicking a tile will turn it on or off based on a hidden pattern.


    3. Some
    tiles may also affect other tiles when clicked.


    4. Watch how the tiles
    change and find the hidden pattern.


    5. Turn off all the tiles to win the
    game.


    6. Use the Peek button to see the pattern of one tile for a hint.'
